{"seq":3,"slug":"recall-latency-eval","title":"召回率-延迟评估与 A/B","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/integration-eval/recall-latency-eval","wordCount":3154,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"召回率-延迟评估与-a-b\">召回率-延迟评估与 A/B</h1><p>相关性工程里最昂贵的错误不是选错参数，而是&quot;改了参数、抽样看了几条、感觉变好了、于是全量发布&quot;。这类决策的问题不在于主观，而在于不可复现：三个月后没人能说清当初为什么选了 0.7 这个权重，也没人能在下一次语料变化时判断它是否还成立。这一篇建立的是一个最小可行的评估闭环——一份判断列表、两个指标、一次分桶实验——它的全部目的就是让&quot;变好了&quot;这句话可以被别人独立验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>检索链路的评估要同时回答两个不同问题：候选池里有没有该有的文档（召回），以及这些文档排得对不对（排序）。这两个问题必须用两个不同的指标度量，因为它们的失效模式不同——召回不足时无论排序多好都救不回丢失的文档，而排序不佳时召回指标完全看不出问题。</p>\n<p>定义一个查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的相关文档集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，系统返回的前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则召回率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recall@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recall@}k = \\frac{|R_q \\cap S_k|}{|R_q|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它对位置不敏感（只要相关文档进了前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 就计入），因此反映的是召回段的行为。排序质量用 NDCG@k 度量，它对每个位置按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\log_2(i+1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3762em;vertical-align:-0.5311em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2341em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2659em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5311em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 折损：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>NDCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>IDCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DCG@}k = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{2^{\\text{rel}_i} - 1}{\\log_2(i+1)}, \\qquad \\text{NDCG@}k = \\frac{\\text{DCG@}k}{\\text{IDCG@}k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>折损函数的设计意图是：把一个高相关文档从第 1 位挪到第 3 位，指标的下降幅度大于把它从第 8 位挪到第 10 位，这与用户感知一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>度量的链路段</th>\n<th>数据依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>候选池完整性</td>\n<td>Recall@k</td>\n<td>召回 + 过滤</td>\n<td>判断列表需覆盖&quot;基线未召回但相关&quot;的文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序质量</td>\n<td>NDCG@k</td>\n<td>融合 + 重排</td>\n<td>判断列表需有分级标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>P50/P99 延迟、段内存</td>\n<td>全链路</td>\n<td>真实流量或等价压测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户收益</td>\n<td>相关性事件率</td>\n<td>全链路</td>\n<td>随机分桶的线上实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  J[&quot;判断列表: 查询 → 分级相关文档&quot;] --&gt; R[&quot;算 Recall@k&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt; N[&quot;算 NDCG@k&quot;]&#10;  C1[&quot;配置 A (基线)&quot;] --&gt; R&#10;  C1 --&gt; N&#10;  C2[&quot;配置 B (改动)&quot;] --&gt; R&#10;  C2 --&gt; N&#10;  R --&gt; D{&quot;B 的 Recall 提升?&quot;}&#10;  N --&gt; E{&quot;B 的 NDCG 提升?&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;归因: 改动影响召回段&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;归因: 改动影响排序段&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; H[&quot;线上分桶验证&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  J[\"判断列表: 查询 → 分级相关文档\"] --&gt; R[\"算 Recall@k\"]\n  J --&gt; N[\"算 NDCG@k\"]\n  C1[\"配置 A (基线)\"] --&gt; R\n  C1 --&gt; N\n  C2[\"配置 B (改动)\"] --&gt; R\n  C2 --&gt; N\n  R --&gt; D{\"B 的 Recall 提升?\"}\n  N --&gt; E{\"B 的 NDCG 提升?\"}\n  D --&gt; F[\"归因: 改动影响召回段\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"归因: 改动影响排序段\"]\n  F --&gt; H[\"线上分桶验证\"]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>图中&quot;配置 A 与配置 B&quot;必须在同一份判断列表、同一分片数、同一窗口参数下对比，否则差异里会混入环境效应——这是离线评估最常见的失真来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判断列表-评估的前提\">判断列表：评估的前提</h2><p>判断列表（judgment list）是一组&quot;查询 → 相关文档及分级&quot;的映射。它不需要很大，但必须覆盖真实的查询分布。</p>\n<p>构造方式有三种，成本递增：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>人工标注</strong>：抽样真实查询（从搜索日志里取，按查询频次分层），对每个查询的 top-N 结果人工打分级。分级通常用三档：0（不相关）、1（相关）、2（高度相关）。每个查询标注 20–50 条即可，规模在 50–200 个查询时已经能支撑主要决策。</li>\n<li><strong>从行为信号派生</strong>：把有点击、有转化、有停留时长的文档标为相关。成本低，但偏差明显——未曝光的好文档永远不会被标为相关，因此评估会偏向&quot;已经排得靠前的文档&quot;，导致指标无法反映召回端的改进。至少与人工标注混用。</li>\n<li><strong>从已有系统派生</strong>：把当前线上系统的 top-1 视为相关。这是最省事也最危险的做法：它把基线固化成正确答案，任何与基线不同的排序都会被判为退化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一份可用的判断列表需要满足两条性质。第一，查询按类型分层（精确查找、长句探索、带约束的过滤查询），因为不同融合策略在不同查询类型上的表现差异常常大于它们的平均差异。第二，标注者之间需要有基本一致的分级标准，至少对&quot;2 分与 0 分&quot;的判定要统一；1 分的模糊区间造成的噪声通常可以接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两个指标的分工\">两个指标的分工</h2><p>召回率与排序指标衡量的是链路的不同段，混用会让归因失效。</p>\n<p><strong>Recall@k</strong>（召回率）衡量&quot;该出现的文档有没有进候选池&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recall@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>相关文档</mtext><mo>∩</mo><mtext>返回的 top-</mtext><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>相关文档</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recall@}k = \\frac{|\\text{相关文档} \\cap \\text{返回的 top-}k|}{|\\text{相关文档}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相关文档</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相关文档</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返回的</span><span class=\"mord\"> top-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它主要反映召回阶段与过滤阶段的行为，对融合与重排的细节不敏感。当你在调 ANN 参数（<code>num_candidates</code>、<code>m</code>、<code>ef_construction</code>）或调查返回条数不足时，看的是它。</p>\n<p><strong>NDCG@k</strong>（归一化折损累计增益）衡量&quot;排序好不好&quot;，对位置敏感：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>NDCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>IDCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DCG@}k = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{2^{\\text{rel}_i} - 1}{\\log_2(i+1)}, \\qquad \\text{NDCG@}k = \\frac{\\text{DCG@}k}{\\text{IDCG@}k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NDCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母 IDCG 是理想排序下的 DCG，因此结果落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。分级值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>rel</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rel}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 0/1/2。它主要反映融合与重排的效果。当你在调权重、改融合方式、换重排模型时，看的是它。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>改动类型</th>\n<th>主指标</th>\n<th>辅助指标</th>\n<th>为什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ANN 参数（<code>m</code>/<code>ef_construction</code>/<code>num_candidates</code>）</td>\n<td>Recall@k</td>\n<td>延迟 P50/P99</td>\n<td>图参数决定候选池里有什么，不决定排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化与 <code>oversample</code></td>\n<td>Recall@k</td>\n<td>段内存</td>\n<td>量化损失表现为&quot;漏召回&quot;而非&quot;排序错&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤位置（先/一体/后）</td>\n<td>Recall@k + 返回条数</td>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>首要症状是返回条数不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>融合方式（RRF vs 线性）</td>\n<td>NDCG@k</td>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>排序质量是唯一可比较的量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重与归一化参数</td>\n<td>NDCG@k</td>\n<td>分数分布</td>\n<td>权重只影响排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排模型与候选数</td>\n<td>NDCG@k</td>\n<td>延迟预算</td>\n<td>重排改进的是头部顺序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;改动: ANN 参数 / 量化&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;测 Recall@k&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;改动: 融合 / 权重 / 重排&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;测 NDCG@k&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E{&quot;Recall 提升?&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt; F{&quot;NDCG 提升?&quot;}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;改动无效: 检查测量口径或候选池上限&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| H[&quot;检查延迟是否在预算内&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| I[&quot;改动无效: 检查是否回退&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| J[&quot;检查延迟与长尾查询&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; K[&quot;进入线上 A/B&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[\"改动: ANN 参数 / 量化\"] --&gt; B[\"测 Recall@k\"]\n  C[\"改动: 融合 / 权重 / 重排\"] --&gt; D[\"测 NDCG@k\"]\n  B --&gt; E{\"Recall 提升?\"}\n  D --&gt; F{\"NDCG 提升?\"}\n  E --&gt;|否| G[\"改动无效: 检查测量口径或候选池上限\"]\n  E --&gt;|是| H[\"检查延迟是否在预算内\"]\n  F --&gt;|否| I[\"改动无效: 检查是否回退\"]\n  F --&gt;|是| J[\"检查延迟与长尾查询\"]\n  H --&gt; K[\"进入线上 A/B\"]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><p>图中两条路径的判据不同，这是&quot;用错指标会得出错误结论&quot;的具体形式：用 NDCG 评估 ANN 参数改动时，NDCG 可能因为排序恰好没变而完全不动，从而把一次有效的召回改进判为无效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化重打分的评估口径\">量化重打分的评估口径</h2><p>量化索引的评估有一个专门的陷阱：量化造成的损失表现为&quot;相关文档从候选池里掉出去&quot;，因此它的症状与召回参数问题一致，只能用 Recall@k 观察。评估流程是：</p>\n<p>用同一份判断列表，先测 <code>hnsw</code>（无量化基线）的 Recall@10 与 P99 延迟，再测 <code>bbq_hnsw</code> 在同一 <code>num_candidates</code> 下的两组数字，得到召回损失；然后在这组量化配置上扫描 <code>oversample</code>（1.5、2、3、5），观察召回如何回升、延迟如何上升，找到&quot;召回损失降到可接受范围且延迟仍在预算内&quot;的点。</p>\n<p>这个扫描里有一个必须固定的变量：<code>oversample</code> 会同时抬高候选数，因此扫描时要么固定 <code>num_candidates</code> 并接受候选数随之变化，要么固定&quot;实际参与重打分的条数&quot;并让 <code>num_candidates</code> 反向调整。不固定任何一个，扫描结果就无法解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离线评估的实现要点\">离线评估的实现要点</h2><p>离线评估的三种做法及其适用性：</p>\n<p><strong>重放（replay）</strong>：把历史查询打到新配置上，用判断列表算指标。优点是完全可复现、可以对比任意多组配置；缺点是历史查询的分布不代表线上流量分布（线上有会话上下文、有个性化）。</p>\n<p><strong>池化（pooling）</strong>：跑完一组配置后，把所有配置的 top-k 结果合并去重，对该并集统一标注。这是避免&quot;只标注了基线结果&quot;偏差的标准做法——如果只标注基线 top-10，任何能召回基线看不到的好文档的新配置都无法被评估到。这套&quot;合并各系统结果再统一判定&quot;的流程是 TREC 评估体系的既定做法（来源：TREC 官方概览, <a href=\"https://trec.nist.gov/overview.html）。\">https://trec.nist.gov/overview.html）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>留出（holdout）</strong>：把判断列表分成调参集与评估集。权重这类只有一个自由度的参数极易过拟合到几十个查询上，必须留出评估集来验证。</p>\n<p>实现时有两个细节决定结果是否可信。第一，<strong>固定分片数与副本数</strong>：RRF 依赖全局名次，而名次由分片归并决定，因此分片数变化会改变融合排序——对比两组配置时如果分片数不同，差异里混进了分片效应。第二，<strong>固定 <code>size</code> 与 <code>rank_window_size</code></strong>：窗口大小同时影响召回与融合，是两个容易在对比中被无意改动的变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线上-a-b-的分桶与判读\">线上 A/B 的分桶与判读</h2><p>离线评估只能证明&quot;在你的判断列表上变好了&quot;，它无法回答&quot;真实用户是否受益&quot;。上线前需要一次分桶实验。</p>\n<p>实验设计的三个必要元素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>随机分桶</strong>：按用户 ID（不是查询 ID，因为同一用户的多次查询相关）做哈希分桶，保证同一用户始终落在同一组，避免体验抖动。</li>\n<li><strong>主指标与护栏指标同时定义</strong>：主指标通常是&quot;相关性事件率&quot;（点击、转化、加购），护栏指标是延迟 P99 与错误率。只定义主指标的实验容易用延迟退化换相关性提升。</li>\n<li><strong>最小样本量事先估算</strong>：相关性指标的方差通常比延迟大得多，所需样本量往往超出直觉。样本量不足时观察到的&quot;提升&quot;多数是噪声。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判读时需要注意三种常见误判。第一种是只看均值不看长尾：某一类查询（例如精确型号查询）上的退化会被其他查询的提升掩盖，因此必须按查询类型分层看指标。第二种是把&quot;没变差&quot;当成&quot;没问题&quot;：护栏指标在统计上无显著差异，可能是因为样本量不足，也可能是因为变化确实很小但不为零——后者在长期会累积成延迟债。第三种是提前终止：观察到显著性后立刻停止实验，会在真实效果尚未稳定时得出结论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;离线: 判断列表 + NDCG/Recall&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;指标提升且延迟达标?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[&quot;回到调参: 明确哪一段退化&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[&quot;线上: 随机分桶 A/B&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;主指标: 相关性事件率&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;护栏指标: 延迟 P99, 错误率&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G{&quot;主指标显著提升且护栏无退化?&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[&quot;回滚并定位差异: 离线与线上不一致的原因&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[&quot;扩量并持续监控分数分布&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J{&quot;分数分布漂移?&quot;}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| A&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[&quot;保持&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"离线: 判断列表 + NDCG/Recall\"] --&gt; B{\"指标提升且延迟达标?\"}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[\"回到调参: 明确哪一段退化\"]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[\"线上: 随机分桶 A/B\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"主指标: 相关性事件率\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"护栏指标: 延迟 P99, 错误率\"]\n  E --&gt; G{\"主指标显著提升且护栏无退化?\"}\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|否| H[\"回滚并定位差异: 离线与线上不一致的原因\"]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[\"扩量并持续监控分数分布\"]\n  I --&gt; J{\"分数分布漂移?\"}\n  J --&gt;|是| A\n  J --&gt;|否| K[\"保持\"]</pre><p>图里最后一个回环（分数分布漂移 → 回到离线评估）是线性融合路线必须接受的运维负担：归一化统计量来自当前结果集，语料变化后最优权重会移动，因此需要定期重跑评估。RRF 路线没有这个回环，这是它在运维成本上的实质优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个可复用的评估记录格式\">一个可复用的评估记录格式</h2><p>评估的价值在于可追溯。每次实验至少记录六项：改动的确切配置（mapping、参数、pipeline 定义）、使用的判断列表版本与查询数、Recall@k 与 NDCG@k、延迟 P50/P99、实验日期、以及结论与后续动作。少任何一项，三个月后的自己都会重新走一遍同样的弯路。</p>\n<p>这份记录也是回答&quot;为什么当初选了这些参数&quot;的唯一依据。在相关性工程里，参数没有先验正确值，只有&quot;在某个判断列表与某份语料上测出来的值&quot;——把测量条件一起记下来，结论才可复用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>判断列表是评估的前提，50–200 个分层查询已能支撑主要决策；从行为信号派生的标注有&quot;偏向已曝光文档&quot;的系统偏差。</li>\n<li>Recall@k 反映召回与过滤段（调 ANN 参数、量化、过滤位置时看它），NDCG@k 反映排序段（调融合、权重、重排时看它）；用错指标会把有效改动判为无效。</li>\n<li>量化损失的评估要扫描 <code>oversample</code>，并固定 <code>num_candidates</code> 或固定参与重打分的条数之一，否则结果无法解释。</li>\n<li>离线评估用池化避免&quot;只标注基线&quot;的偏差，用留出集避免权重过拟合；对比时必须固定分片数与窗口参数。</li>\n<li>线上 A/B 按用户分桶，主指标与护栏指标同时定义，样本量事先估算，并按查询类型分层判读。</li>\n<li>每次实验记录配置、判断列表版本、指标、延迟、日期与结论；线性融合路线还需定期重跑评估以应对分数分布漂移。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此整条链路闭合。如果你刚接手这个系统、需要从零搭一遍，回到 <a href=\"../\">Elasticsearch 向量与混合检索实战</a> 的学习路径建议；如果当前的症状是具体某一类查询不准，按&quot;召回 / 融合 / 重排 / 过滤&quot;四段归因，分别对应 <a href=\"../vector-index/hnsw-params\">HNSW 参数（m/ef_construction）与召回</a>、<a href=\"../hybrid-fusion/rrf-fusion\">RRF 倒数秩融合与权重</a>、<a href=\"../rerank-filter/cross-encoder-rerank\">交叉编码器重排与延迟预算</a> 与 <a href=\"../rerank-filter/filtered-ann\">过滤 ANN：先过滤 vs 后过滤</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"召回率-延迟评估与 A/B","id":"召回率-延迟评估与-a-b"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"判断列表：评估的前提","id":"判断列表-评估的前提"},{"level":2,"text":"两个指标的分工","id":"两个指标的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"量化重打分的评估口径","id":"量化重打分的评估口径"},{"level":2,"text":"离线评估的实现要点","id":"离线评估的实现要点"},{"level":2,"text":"线上 A/B 的分桶与判读","id":"线上-a-b-的分桶与判读"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可复用的评估记录格式","id":"一个可复用的评估记录格式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenSearch neural search 与模型插件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/elasticsearch-vector-hybrid-search/integration-eval/opensearch-neural"},"next":null}